# KNOWN GAP — `Option[T].map(f)` where `f` is a `Callable` PARAMETER builds a
# WRONG-SIZED result slot and the caller reads past it. rc 139 SIGSEGV on a
# plain build; `AddressSanitizer: stack-buffer-overflow` under `--sanitize`.
# Deterministic, 3/3 runs, at `f3feea79` and unchanged by R47 Track B.
#
# MECHANISM (read, not guessed). The combinator adapter picks `result_type`
# from `infer_closure_return_type`, which resolves a closure-STRUCT local
# through `closure_call_fn_for_type` and a `FuncRef` through `fn_sigs` — and for a
# `Callable[T]` PARAMETER, whose GIR local type is ERASED to unit, matches
# neither and falls through to a hardcoded `I64_TYPE`. So `.map()` on an
# `Option[String]` allocates `result_local` as `Option__int64_t` (16 bytes)
# while the surrounding code reads it as `Option__GorgetString` (40 bytes):
#
#     memcpy(&__s15, __v33, sizeof(__gg_Option__int64_t));    <-- 16 written
#     memcpy(&__s9,  __v34, sizeof(__gg_Option__GorgetString)); <-- 40 read
#
# This is the SAME defect Round XXIII Track alpha fixed for the cross-type
# `or_else` shape — "the pre-alpha `_ => recv_type` fall-through mis-sized
# `result_local` at birth and downstream memcpys read/wrote the wrong number of
# bytes" (comment at the `and_then`/`or_else` arm). The `I64_TYPE` fallback is
# the same wrong-default one arm over, for the one closure shape whose type is
# erased. Core #1: the wrong type is chosen where the slot is ALLOCATED.
#
# THE TYPED METADATA ALREADY EXISTS: `ctx.callable_return_type(local_id)` is
# what the direct `Callable`-param CALL arm reads (`calls.rs`, the `UNIT_TYPE`
# local arm). `infer_closure_return_type` does not consult it. Reading it
# there, instead of defaulting to `I64_TYPE`, is the shape the fix should take
# (devbook/24 rule 4 — resolve once, write through).
#
# ⚠ THE PATTERN-MATCH CONSUMER IS LOAD-BEARING for the crash, not for the bug.
# With `.unwrap()` instead of `if r is Some(v)` the same program returns rc 0
# and prints `hello!` — the over-read lands on live stack and is silent. Keep
# the `is Some(v)` form so the repro is visible without a sanitizer.
#
# ⚠ NOT the same class as R47 Track B's register-at-birth conversion, which
# touched this same helper: that one is about DROP REGISTRATION, this one is
# about RESULT TYPE. Track B's fix leaves this byte-identical.
#
# INTENDED: prints `hello!`, rc 0, on C and LLVM, ASan-clean.
String mk(String a, String b):
    return a + b

void go(Callable[String(String)] f):
    Option[String] o = Some(mk("hel", "lo"))
    Option[String] r = o.map(f)
    if r is Some(v):
        print(v)

void main():
    go((String s): mk(s, "!"))
